ISO-10303-21;
/* Os015: ADVANCED_FACE on CYLINDRICAL_SURFACE; 45-degree draft request results in a deformed surface that cannot be re-fitted to any analytic surface family — Draft_Modification Draft_FaceRecomputation; cylinder cannot become cone-like in analytic family; OCC loads (heals) but conservative kernels must reject; mechanism: cylindrical face with same_sense=.T. presented for draft */
